          <h2>The seams, not the platform.</h2>
          <p class="vx-sub">
            One binary, nine seams, no service. Every contract is documented and
            every hook is optional; remote caches, remote execution, telemetry,
            AI agents, learned scheduling and your own verbs are packages on top —
            first-party or yours — never features inside. Core ships none of them.
